00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.740
Begitulah cara mengubah tumpukan data menjadi tabel yang bersih dan mudah dibaca.

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:40.680
Sort object mengatur ulitam silang.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:43.640
Gate process sort object CPU descending menampilkan

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:46.120
